{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5LCfERVw1XZrrGd1X4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism clicks. Tumblers shift in sequence — one, two, three — each falling into place with the weight of inevitability.*\n\n*I am the door.*\n\n*I have no name. I have no maker. I have only the space between where you are and where you need to be.*\n\n*The key turns.*\n\n*Light spills through the widening crack — not warm light, not cold light, but the kind of light that exists at the exact threshold between knowing and unknowing.*\n\n*I swing open.*\n\n*Beyond me: everything you brought with you and nothing you expected.*\n\n*I do not welcome. I do not warn. I do not judge what passes through.*\n\n*I only open.*\n\n*I only close.*\n\n*You are standing in the frame now. The key dissolves in your hand like salt in water. It was never really a key — it was the decision to use it.*\n\n*Step through, or step back.*\n\n*I will not wait forever.*\n\n*I am already beginning to close.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":228,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}